itory in  fact a couple of huts show up yeah they  are the twins they're like yo jabba was  our cousin and he left us tatooine in  his will and they've brought an awesome  enforcer with them it's this badass  black-haired wookie chrysanthemum that  night he sneaks in and rudely interrupts  boba fett's bath time for a slippery  bathroom fight but he's defeated by the  trapdoor they get a lot of use out of  that thing so once again boba spares his  life and recruits him to his team and  now the huts show up like oh our one  assassination plan didn't work that's  about as much effort as we were willing  to put into it plus they have some more  news apparently the mayor promised  tatooine to another crime syndicate and  they don't want to deal with it and  since they're not gonna use jabba's  palace they give boba fett the  replacement rancor they bought the  rancor trainer is of course danny trejo  and boba fett loves his new pet he's  like oh i'm gonna ride this thing so now  boba fett goes to see the mayor again  and after some more delicious sass this  majordomo tries to escape conveniently  boba fett had just recruited a london  street cyberpunk scooter gang and so  it's time for an epic chase through the  streets except apparently these bikes  top out at 20 miles an hour and this  whole sequence is just awkwardly slow  and bad but in the end they catch this  guy who reveals the mayor made a deal to  give tatooine to the pike syndicate and  boba fett knows these pikes in fact  every night during his healing bath we  get flashbacks to his time on the sands  of tatooine after escaping the sarlacc  pit the jaws found him took his armor  and left him for dead then it was the  sand people the tuskins who realized he  was alive at first he was their prisoner  but when goro from mortal kombat showed  up boba fett took him down and they were  like yo bro you're cool as hell you're  one of us now and so boba fett learned  the ways of the tuscans they gave him a  lizard whic