se the pikes bring  in a couple of epic war droids they're  fully shielded you can't hurt these  things as mentors are retreating he gets  a ride from his mechanic friend who came  here to find him because she has a baby  hoda yes little grogu made his choice he  wants to be with his papa mando  unfortunately at the moment they're in  mortal danger and things look bleak but  wait what's this it's the rancor with  boba fett riding it alright this thing  is a beast and working together he and  mando take this thing out yes the rancor  goes on a rampage and very quickly the  battle is won but now cad bane shows up  and he ain't afraid to know rancor knows  this thing's afraid of fire so it's time  for the final showdown between cadbane  and bo buffett as bounty hunters these  two go way back in fact in the clone  wars like they hung out when bobo was a  kid but cad bane's quicker on the draw  oh he's gonna take boba out but boba  fett oh trips him up with the tuscan  gaffy stick and a final fight goal stabs  him i highly doubt they brought this  character into live action just to kill  him immediately so maybe we'll see him  again but now there's another problem  without boba fett here the rancor is out  of control but it's little grogu who  steps in there proving he's the apex  predator the rancor is kinda just a big  frog and he uses the force to calm this  thing down and now together they have a  little nappy time now fenik shand was  notably missing from this whole finale  she bailed early because she tracked  down where the pike leader and the other  crime bosses were hiding and al goes  full punisher assassin mode her boss  boba's not here to show mercy she takes  them all out and so the day is saved and  boba fett has earned his spot as the top  crime boss of tatooine although he shuts  down the spice trade and really isn't  doing any crime so he's more like the  new mayor and more good news and then  after the credit scene the marshall cobb  banth is in boba's 